{"input":"Executable task contract:\nBlocks contract: kind=blocks. on maps each distinct block name to a support block or TABLE. TABLE is reserved, supports must exist, and self-support, cycles, or more than one block directly on a block are malformed. TABLE may support several blocks. goal_on is a partial map using existing blocks or TABLE; self-support, cycles, and multiple blocks directly assigned to one block are contradictory and malformed. The initial state and goals here are well-formed. A block is clear when no block is directly on it. plan is an ordered list of {block,to} actions. A move is legal exactly when block exists and is clear, to is TABLE or an existing clear block distinct from block, and to differs from block's current support. A legal move changes only that block's support. At the first illegal move, include its {legal:false,after:unchanged_on_map} step, stop immediately, and ignore subsequent moves. An empty plan is valid. valid means every proposed move was legal. reaches_goal means the entire plan is valid and every goal_on entry equals the final on-map entry; unspecified supports need not change. shortest_plan is a fresh plan from the INITIAL on-map that satisfies every goal_on entry, minimizes the number of moves, and breaks ties by the lexicographic order of the complete sequence of (block,to) string pairs. It is [] when the initial state already satisfies the goal and null if unreachable. Return exactly a JSON object with steps:[{legal:boolean,after:on_map}], after:on_map, valid:boolean, reaches_goal:boolean, shortest_plan:list_or_null. Include only evaluated steps.\nTask JSON:\n{\"kind\":\"blocks\",\"on\":{\"dune\":\"olive\",\"grove\":\"dune\",\"larch\":\"grove\",\"olive\":\"quartz\",\"quartz\":\"TABLE\"},\"goal_on\":{\"dune\":\"TABLE\",\"grove\":\"dune\",\"larch\":\"TABLE\",\"olive\":\"quartz\",\"quartz\":\"larch\"},\"plan\":[{\"block\":\"larch\",\"to\":\"TABLE\"},{\"block\":\"grove\",\"to\":\"TABLE\"},{\"block\":\"dune\",\"to\":\"TABLE\"},{\"block\":\"grove\",\"to\":\"dune\"},{\"block\":\"olive\",\"to\":\"TABLE\"},{\"block\":\"quartz\",\"to\":\"larch\"},{\"block\":\"olive\",\"to\":\"quartz\"}]}","target":{"after":{"dune":"TABLE","grove":"dune","larch":"TABLE","olive":"quartz","quartz":"larch"},"reaches_goal":true,"shortest_plan":[{"block":"larch","to":"TABLE"},{"block":"grove","to":"TABLE"},{"block":"dune","to":"TABLE"},{"block":"grove","to":"dune"},{"block":"olive","to":"TABLE"},{"block":"quartz","to":"larch"},{"block":"olive","to":"quartz"}],"steps":[{"after":{"dune":"olive","grove":"dune","larch":"TABLE","olive":"quartz","quartz":"TABLE"},"legal":true},{"after":{"dune":"olive","grove":"TABLE","larch":"TABLE","olive":"quartz","quartz":"TABLE"},"legal":true},{"after":{"dune":"TABLE","grove":"TABLE","larch":"TABLE","olive":"quartz","quartz":"TABLE"},"legal":true},{"after":{"dune":"TABLE","grove":"dune","larch":"TABLE","olive":"quartz","quartz":"TABLE"},"legal":true},{"after":{"dune":"TABLE","grove":"dune","larch":"TABLE","olive":"TABLE","quartz":"TABLE"},"legal":true},{"after":{"dune":"TABLE","grove":"dune","larch":"TABLE","olive":"TABLE","quartz":"larch"},"legal":true},{"after":{"dune":"TABLE","grove":"dune","larch":"TABLE","olive":"quartz","quartz":"larch"},"legal":true}],"valid":true}}
